      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790346978743,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is loop parallelism, a form of data parallelism: \nyou take a loop whose iterations don't depend on each other, you\nrun each iteration as its own thread.\n\nThe loop body becomes the kernel, and the loop counter becomes each\nthreads element number.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is loop parallelism, a form of data parallelism: \nyou take a loop whose iterations don't depend on each other, you\nrun each iteration as its own thread.\n\nThe loop body becomes the kernel, and the loop counter becomes each\nthreads element number.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
